        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nahoshi nindi, Hembenu wuŋaji, ilenu yaloŋa, muloŋa wamwinu wami keŋa wushiki, nikuloŋa kwami keŋa kumwekani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu wukwila mwenimu nakooleki, chochimu nawa ni mwana kamuntu wukukakelamu mbe, wukuhembaŋa sabata abuli kuyijilola, wukuhembaŋa achikasa chindi abuli kwila chuma chatama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela muntu wakumuza wacheŋi, nadibombi dehi kudi Yehova, aleki kuhosha nindi, Chalala Yehova wakapambula kudi antu indi; nichihewu aleki kuhosha nindi, Tiyenu, ami nimutondu wawuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa Yehova nateni dehi ayihewu akuhembaŋa asabata jami, akutondaŋa yuma yinakeŋa ami, akukakela mwayachitiyaŋenu chami, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Mwitala dami nimumbaŋu jami nakayinkachuma chakuyanuka nachu, niijina dabadika dawanyana amayala nawanyana awambanda. Nakayinka ijina dahaya nyaka dakabula kufumishawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niantu akunyuza yacheŋa akudibomba kudi Yehova kulonda amukalakeli, akeŋi ijina daYehova, ekali ambuŋindi, ejima ahembaŋa sabata abuli kuyijilola, akakelaŋa mwaya chitiyaŋenu chami, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nakayishikŋa kumpidi yami yajila, nakayizaŋalesha mwitala dami dakulombela. Ninyilambu yawuyakushita, niyimuna yawu yakuketula akayiitŋa hakameŋa kami, Muloŋatala dami akaditena nawu itala dakulombela danyuza yawantu yejima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu anyama ejima amumpata inzenu mudyi, ninenu anyama amulusesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu indi, akwakutala mukala, hiyamputamesu, wejima wawu hiyakwakuyambashana. Wejima wawu hituwa twatumama twakabolaŋa, mudimuwawu wakulota nakukamujoka, akeŋa kwatulu hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eŋa, atuwa owuafwa hakudya, hiyekutaŋaku; atubiŋa awa hiyatweshaŋa kushinshika mwayachumaku. Wejima wawu atalisha dehi munjila jawu jakudya yuma yawuyawukombi, anafumafumi kumbadi jejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawu, Inzenu nileti vinyu, tudichilenu walwa washetana, nikumadiki twakela neyi namutukwila lelu, chakasweja nikubadikamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
